OL,3,AKing of Norway's health has worsened,
OL,4,Apalace says
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Harald V of Norway's health has
OL,7,Fworsened, the palace has said, as he
OL,8,Fremains in hospital receiving
OL,9,Fantibiotics for a bacterial infection
OL,10,Fin his bloodstream.
OL,12,FThe monarch has responded to treatment
OL,13,Fdespite the deterioration in his
OL,14,Fcondition, according to the palace, but
OL,15,Fhe will remain at Oslo University
OL,16,FHospital, Rikshospitalet, and on leave
OL,17,Ffrom royal duties until further notice.
OL,19,FThe 89-year-old, who has been on the
OL,20,Fthrone since 1991, was admitted to
OL,21,Fhospital and put on sick leave a week
OL,22,Fago.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
